#: input/business-processes/GDHCN.TrustDomain.Join.bpmn:101
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Authorized WHO staff of the GDHCN Secretariat (Framework V, VI). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/GDHCNSecretariat."
msgstr "Personal autorizado de la OMS de la Secretaría de la Red Mundial (Marco V, VI). ActorDefinition http://smart.who.int/trust/ActorDefinition/GDHCNSecretariat."

